Description: enable V-Sync and fix the SDL2 event loop
 Request V-Sync with SDL_GL_SetSwapInterval(1) right after the GL context is
 created; the fixed 25 ms delay is now only used when V-Sync is refused.
 Only one event was read per frame, and the key code was tested whatever the
 event type, on an uninitialized SDL_Event when the queue was empty.
 All pending events are now handled, Esc/Q/F react to key presses only
 (without auto-repeat), and SDL_GLContext is no longer declared as a pointer.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
